{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12235170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12235170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223517001:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 가려움은 금방 가라앉을 거예요.","source_cn":"放心吧，待会就不会痒了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1975282B100ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223517002:1":{"text":"뭐?","source_cn":"啊？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623A21BCCA067E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223517003:1":{"text":"이건 비페리안의 실험실에서 나온 뱀독이에요. 먹으면 답이 없다는 걸 이미 확인했죠.","source_cn":"我们已经确认过了，这是维珀里安实验室的蛇毒，吃了就没救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA7C52EBBF5F3FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223517004:1":{"text":"죽으면 가려울 일도 없으니까요!","source_cn":"死人，是不会发痒的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64847A2F56A4984B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223517005:0":{"text":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","source_cn":"——魔法师！大魔法师！我完了，你要什么我都答应！救救我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF6F9DA4F81EBAF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","female":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","variant_male_record_index":"140453","variant_female_record_index":"140454","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1223517005":{"text":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","source_cn":"——魔法师！大魔法师！我完了，你要什么我都答应！救救我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF6F9DA4F81EBAF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","female":"...마법사! 네가 원하는 건 전부 들어줄 테니까 제발 살려줘!","variant_male_record_index":"140453","variant_female_record_index":"140454","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223517006:0":{"text":"당신은 정말 좋은 사람이야!","source_cn":"大善人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8249827A85D0C750","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"당신은 정말 좋은 사람이야!","female":"당신은 정말 좋은 사람이야!","variant_male_record_index":"140455","variant_female_record_index":"140456","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223517008:1":{"text":"방법이 아예 없는 건 아니에요. 블러디 로즈의 꽃잎 알죠? 그걸 우린 물을 마시면 해독할 수 있어요.","source_cn":"倒也有办法，血薇帮种植的血薇花瓣知道吧，泡过的水喝一下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6103940240301054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223517009:1":{"text":"네, 네가 날 속이는 건지 어떻게 알아!","source_cn":"我、我怎么知道你是不是在骗我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1932D08B036E0448","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1223517009":{"text":"네, 네가 날 속이는 건지 어떻게 알아!","source_cn":"我、我怎么知道你是不是在骗我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1932D08B036E0448","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223517010:1":{"text":"하지만, 하지만... 해독제를 구하러 블러디 로즈로 가라니, 죽으러 가라는 거잖아?!","source_cn":"但是、但是……让我去找血薇帮要解药，不就等于自投罗网？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F65655BB3A281C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223517011:1":{"text":"맞아요. 순순히 죄를 인정해야 목숨을 건질 수 있다고요!","source_cn":"没错，你必须乖乖认罪！才能保命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE9E5F67BA003FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223517012:1":{"text":"젠장, 그럴 순 없는데...!","source_cn":"可恶，不甘心啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB984EC677760DCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223517013:1":{"text":"목숨까지 버리면서 복수를 할 필요가 있을까?","source_cn":"命都没了还谈什么报仇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3562ADFC85684B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223517014:1":{"text":"맞아. 해독제 필요 없어? 우린 필요해!","source_cn":"没错啊，你不要解药，我们要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x177EF6DC30716C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223517015:1":{"text":"좋아... 그래. 목숨을 구하기 위해 항복하자고, 형제들. 블러디 로즈에 자수하러 가자.","source_cn":"好吧……兄弟们，为了保命放弃抵抗，跟我去血薇帮认罪吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162CF24F5CA119D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223517016:0":{"text":"녹스, 저들을 데리고 가요! 이제 당신을 따라서 순순히 블러디 로즈로 갈 거예요!","source_cn":"诺克，你把他们带回去吧，他们现在求都要求着跟你回血薇帮呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847ADDE4B09C3355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1223517017:1":{"text":"좋아요. 수고하셨습니다!","source_cn":"明白，辛苦你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x415B8CEE7CA0B583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:1223517018:0":{"text":"레나타 일당은 블러디 로즈에 체포되었다...","source_cn":"雷纳塔等人被押回了血薇帮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC206855BA527DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"그럼 그냥 죽으시던지","source_cn":"那等死吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1666A96C49148AE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼 그냥 죽으시던지","female":"그럼 그냥 죽으시던지","variant_male_record_index":"67744","variant_female_record_index":"67745","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","